<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41447" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιτροπ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for a trustee</i> or <i>guardian,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. νόμοι</span> the laws <i>of
				guardianship,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				927e
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. λόγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.H.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					20
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				Hyp.
				<u>Or.</u>
				65
			</span></i> tit., <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				300.24
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cod.Just.</u>
				3.10.1.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of character,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐεργετικοὺς ἐπιτροπικοὺς χρηστοήθεις</span>
			<i>protective, fit to be a guardian</i> or <i>trustee,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ptol.
				<u>Tetr.</u>
				163
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>having held the office of procurator,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ephes.
				3
			</span></i>No.<i><span class="en">
				49
			</span></i>.</div>
